<title>CANADA: CBRS sets A-1 rating for Suncor paper.</title>
<headline>CBRS sets A-1 rating for Suncor paper.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service said on Thursday it assigned an A-1 rating on Suncor Inc's C$300 million commercial paper program, with a stable outlook.</p>
<p>Suncor recently filed a short-term promissory notes information memorandum and selected CIBC Wood Gundy and RBC Dominion Securities as agents foe the sale of the notes.</p>
<p>CBRS said the A-1 rating reflected Suncor's strong cash flow generation, low debt and strong liquidity.</p>
</text>
